rule priced_media v1
description "A media parcel's price, which a parcel that is not media does not have, from its weight. An example expects no price for a media parcel: an example that expects no value where the rule answers one"

inputs
  weight     : mass[oz]  range >=1oz <=32oz
  media_only : bool

outputs
  price : money[USDc]?  round down(1USDc)

table price_of
policy unique
| media_only | weight     | -> price : money[USDc]? |
| false      | -          | none                    |
| true       | <=1lb      | 439USDc                 |
| true       | >1lb <=2lb | 513USDc                 |

examples
| weight | media_only | -> price |
| 1oz    | false      | none     |
| 20oz   | true       | none     |
